<title>USA: Tarrant County, Texas, Health Corp $23 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Tarrant County, Texas, Health Corp $23 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said Thursday it tentatively priced $23 million of Tarrant County, Texas, Health Facilities Development Corporation hospital revenue refunding and improvement bonds for Fort Worth Osteopathic Hospital Inc project, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.77 percent in 2025.</p>
<p>The bonds are MBIA insured.</p>
